{"ID":"20240513083021-lh1fcq7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083021-lh1fcq7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083021-lh1fcq7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171915-c5gjod3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171915-c5gjod3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:42,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171915-c5gjod3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:914,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:914\u0026#125;","title":"291","type":"doc","updated":"20240514174526"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513171915-c5gjod3","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 881px;","id":"20240513171915-c5gjod3","updated":"20240514174526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"218-5 L, YH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69歲 瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝癌"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠：睡眠可，晚上睡覺全身感覺熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飲食：胃口不錯，味覺好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二便：大便可以，飯後就想上大號，不是完榖不化，小便色深黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸腹：心臟比較鬆，腹水消退很慢，肝的部份整天都會痛，但不像以前痛的那麼厲害，有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身：脖子後面緊沒有改善（天柱痛），其它酸痛改善很多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其它：有痰咳不出。精神還可以。以前開刀有拿腫瘤，三個月後有長出來，又做栓塞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈弦細數，附骨。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝家陰實之脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕。\n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：肝家陰實好轉中。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方： \n曲池、足三里"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對後部大筋痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"後谿、申脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對肩關節不好活動。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"公孫、內關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治胃心胸部之病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天突、巨闕、關元"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治心，心募巨關，小腸募關元。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"期門、左肝關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肝，肝募期門。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"章門"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治臟病，臟會章門。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水分、水道、陰陵泉"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→利水。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天柱、大杼"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治天柱痛，因陽氣不足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝俞、脾俞、腎俞"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肝實脾補腎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治腰痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n1.同五月十二日，方加\n金鈴子三錢、延胡索三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肝區痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"陽起石三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補陽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→化瘀止痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"餘同前，三付。\n2.同五月十五日，五付，六碗煮二碗，平時可多喝一碗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1.一直全身感覺熱就不會有事。\n2.脈弦細數附骨，肝家陰實脈。\n3.小便量慢慢增加是對的，如果我們瞬間攻出來，水還是會回來，小便讓自己排出來，是讓身體自己吸收掉，因為腹水色是深黃是高蛋白的營養，如果出來太快，營養被抽掉會導致貧血，任何肝病到後來都是貧血。\n4.金鈴子、延胡索是治療肝區的痛，肝癌的痛，我們各用三錢，若這樣還不能止痛，我們會用到五錢以上。\n5.開始來的時候我們是用胃苓湯來保持他的胃氣，但胃苓湯沒有把他的水排出，所以我們會用實脾飲或分消湯，二者間的差異是前者用枳殼，後者用枳實。他吃我們的分消湯小便開始排了，雖然不多，但排太多會導致營養失去。\n6.我們有「天柱傾，命在旦夕。」所以我們可以讓他趴著，針天柱、大杼（東垣：「五臟氣亂，針天柱、大杼。」）如果一般肩項痛，後谿、申脈下去就好了，就是天柱痛不能去掉，因為陽不夠才會天柱痛。\n7.肝家虛證用補氣治濕湯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}